---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — Hustle Zone YEG" description="Hustle Zone YEG terms and conditions governing use of our platform and services.">
  <article class="policy-article">
    <div class="container policy-container">
      <div class="policy-header rp-reveal">
        <span class="section-label">LEGAL</span>
        <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="policy-date">Last updated: August 29, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-body rp-reveal">
        <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using Hustle Zone YEG ("the Platform"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, do not use the Platform.</p>

        <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>Hustle Zone YEG provides a business operating system combining project management, invoicing, email, social media management, and client portal functionality in a single dashboard.</p>

        <h2>3. User Accounts</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You must provide accurate, current, and complete information during registration. You are responsible for all activity under your account.</p>

        <h2>4. Subscriptions & Billing</h2>
        <p>Paid plans are billed monthly or annually as selected. Payments are processed through our third-party payment processor. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. No refunds for partial months.</p>

        <h2>5. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the Platform for unlawful purposes</li>
          <li>Attempt to breach security or access other users' data</li>
          <li>Upload malicious code or interfere with Platform operation</li>
          <li>Use the Platform to send spam or unauthorized communications</li>
          <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The Platform, including its design, code, and brand assets, is owned by Hustle Zone YEG. You retain ownership of data you input. We claim no intellectual property rights over your content.</p>

        <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>The Platform is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. Hustle Zone YEG shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the Platform, including loss of data, revenue, or business opportunities.</p>

        <h2>8. Termination</h2>
        <p>We may suspend or terminate your account for violation of these terms. Upon termination, your access ceases and your data will be deleted within 30 days unless required otherwise by law.</p>

        <h2>9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of Alberta, Canada. Any disputes shall be resolved in the courts of Calgary, Alberta.</p>

        <h2>10. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We may modify these terms at any time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance. We will notify users of material changes via email or Platform notification.</p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> legal@hustlezoneyeg.com<br/>
        Hustle Zone YEG<br/>
        Calgary, Alberta, Canada</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .policy-article { padding: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-10); }
  .policy-container { max-width: 720px; }
  .policy-header { margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
  .policy-header h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-h1); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--track-h1); line-height: var(--leading-h1);
    color: var(--text-heading); margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-3);
  }
  .policy-date { font-size: var(--text-small); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .policy-body h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h3); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    color: var(--text-heading); margin-top: var(--space-7);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .policy-body p {
    font-size: var(--size-body); color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .policy-body ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-5); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .policy-body li {
    font-size: var(--size-body); color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>